---
title: "Mapping Senegal's small farms from space, with a fraction of the data"
date: 2026-09-29
tags: [research, news]
author: "Constantino Panagopulos"
description: "New Cambridge research shows Tessera can map crops on Senegal's smallholder farms more accurately than current methods, using a fraction of the computing power and ground data."
---

